LAMMPS (23 Jun 2022 - Update 1)
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p s
atom_style      atomic

read_data       data.bar_L${Lnm}nm_init
read_data       data.bar_L2nm_init
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 -37.862793) to (11.431397 14.4597 37.862793)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  656 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.006 seconds

pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff      * * ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy Cu Cu
Reading eam/alloy potential file ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy with DATE: 2007-10-12

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

group           lower type 1
328 atoms in group lower
group           upper type 2
328 atoms in group upper

variable        dx equal 2.0*5.715698285342089/10.0
variable        rc equal 0.7*2.556138050115838
displace_atoms  upper move ${dx} 0.0 0.0 units box
displace_atoms  upper move 1.14313965706842 0.0 0.0 units box
Displacing atoms ...
delete_atoms    overlap ${rc} upper lower
delete_atoms    overlap 1.78929663508109 upper lower
